#3600
A Lagoon~
   The opening in the crags to the east has allowed the formation of this
small, shallow lagoon. Like liquid within a bowl, the crags lagoon the water
in all directions, leaving the waters fairly calm, aside from a few humps
that roll across the waters from waves that manage to break through the small
opening to the east.
