Dense Jungle~
   Hundreds of birds inhabit the tree here, making you cringe from the sound
of their constant chatter. Small felines scatter upon sensing your presence,
as if conditioned to be hypersensitive to potential danger. The trails taper
off here, making passage difficult, though you manage to cut yourself a path
wherever you please, except to the west, where a large boulder blocks your
