A Jungle Clearing~
   Fastened between two palms is a bench, and a braided rope made from kelp
has been strung across further up the palms to hold bags of food off of the
ground and out of reach of animals. A fire pit has been constructed from large
shards of black rock. Palm leaves rest upon wooden beams that are secured on
various trees, forming sturdy roofing designed to keep the area dry during the
rains.
